---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import HeaderNav from '../../components/HeaderNav';
import Footer from '../../components/contact/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="KRONE IoT Telemetry | Case Study" 
  description="Architecture Report: KRONE IoT Telemetry"
>
  <HeaderNav client:load slot="header" />

  <div class="w-full min-h-screen bg-[var(--color-canvas)] pt-32 sm:pt-40 pb-24 text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">
    <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 md:px-12">
      
      <header class="mb-16 md:mb-24">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-6 md:mb-8">
          <span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-mono text-sm tracking-widest uppercase font-bold">Case Study 01</span>
          <div class="h-px bg-[var(--color-border)] flex-1"></div>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black tracking-tighter leading-tight mb-6 md:mb-8 text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">
          KRONE IoT <br/><span class="text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] font-medium">Telemetry.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl md:text-2xl text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] font-normal leading-relaxed">
          Predictive Analytics &amp; Fleet Management architecture capable of ingesting high-throughput sensor data globally.
        </p>
      </header>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-[var(--color-text-secondary)]">
        
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-12 mb-4">The Problem</h2>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          Managing a global fleet of agricultural machinery requires real-time insight into hardware health, location, and yield data. Traditional polling architectures were failing under the load of thousands of simultaneous socket connections, resulting in dropped telemetry packets and delayed predictive maintenance alerts.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-12 mb-4">The Architecture</h2>
        <div class="w-full p-6 sm:p-8 bg-[#111114] border border-zinc-800 rounded-2xl mb-8 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm overflow-x-auto text-zinc-300 shadow-inner">
          <pre>
[ Machinery Fleet ] --&gt; MQTT/WSS --&gt; [ Load Balancer ]
                                          |
                                 [ FastAPI Ingestion ]
                                          |
                                   [ Apache Kafka ]
                                   /              \
                    [ Redis Cache ]         [ PostgreSQL (TimescaleDB) ]
                          |                       |
                  [ Real-time UI ]        [ Predictive AI Model ]
          </pre>
        </div>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-8">
          To solve the throughput bottleneck, we shifted to an event-driven architecture. <strong>FastAPI</strong> handles the massive influx of WebSocket connections asynchronously, instantly dumping raw telemetry payloads into an <strong>Apache Kafka</strong> cluster. This decoupling allows the ingestion layer to remain lightning-fast, while downstream consumers process the data at their own pace.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[var(--color-text-primary)] mt-12 mb-4">The Impact</h2>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-4 mb-16">
          <li class="flex gap-4 text-base sm:text-lg"><span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">→</span> Scaled ingestion from 1,000 to 50,000+ concurrent machines.</li>
          <li class="flex gap-4 text-base sm:text-lg"><span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">→</span> Reduced data pipeline latency from 4 seconds to under 200ms.</li>
          <li class="flex gap-4 text-base sm:text-lg"><span class="text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold">→</span> Predictive AI integration reduced average hardware downtime by 24%.</li>
        </ul>

      </div>
    </article>
  </div>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</Layout>
